  "title": "Cranberry Brie Bites",
  "description": "These cranberry Brie bites are crispy squares of puff pastry filled with cranberry sauce, Brie cheese, and walnuts for bite-sized Thanksgiving appetizers with wow factor.",
  "authors": [
    "Julie Hubert"
  ],
  "date_published": "2017-11-07T20:39:41-05:00",
