  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) round Brie cheese",
    "cooking spray",
    "1 sheet frozen puff pastry, thawed",
    "0.5 cup cranberry sauce",
    "0.5 cup finely chopped walnuts",
    "sea salt to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f9PZE2tbXraZcyKzkh0nPbUSe9w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-259545-cranberry-brie-bites-VAT-4x3-step-01-a15d8315447e4b5c9bcf0f3442ed7483.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259545/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove and discard rind from Brie cheese. Place cheese in the freezer for 20 minutes to make it easier to cut.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9mbN-jIkkhbMjewk0ov1Qx5teDQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-259545-cranberry-brie-bites-VAT-4x3-step-03-308122bd48ed4c14a931072c50b71f91.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259545/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, oil a 24-cup mini muffin pan with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rlUxkuXOPrXNywcuGh88KLeHzgc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-259545-cranberry-brie-bites-VAT-4x3-step-02-53517f8997264e65b6ed645139affb4b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259545/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll puff pastry sheet out into a 10x14-inch rectangle. Cut sheet lengthwise into 4 even strips and then crosswise into 6 even strips, making 24 squares. Separate squares and gently press each one into a prepared muffin cup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cK5c6mjDhIJkg6rjCF8VsOy_mls=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-259545-cranberry-brie-bites-VAT-4x3-step-04-8f147c9168d848418b8252f2fc56f898.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259545/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove chilled Brie from the freezer; cut into 24 pieces, approximately 3/4-inch in size.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2pw0QXRO3xaDT_A4ndjPYjxBX-4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-259545-cranberry-brie-bites-VAT-4x3-step-05-079af2114a104cb0a70833a40da098c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259545/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add 1 teaspoon cranberry sauce to each pastry-lined muffin cup, then press in a piece of Brie and top with 1 teaspoon chopped walnuts. Season each bite with a pinch of sea salt. Transfer muffin pan to the refrigerator and chill for at least 30 minutes, or cover and chill for up to 3 days. When ready to bake, preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4bRjMCpr7kcmKFiWebNwSbOTdOs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-259545-cranberry-brie-bites-VAT-4x3-step-06-bba93fcf2cda438b98b920a51133de0e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259545/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake bites in the preheated oven until golden brown, 18 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CCr_1y85RFJRRkvTtizGk5Qp23E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-259545-cranberry-brie-bites-VAT-4x3-step-08-7503b63eafe34581b0d5933a61faec86.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259545/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve warm, and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m-iU1DPUVplWquDTr5qivH8gu7w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-259545-cranberry-brie-bites-VAT-hero-4x3-a-48af56a1a58743bca3b7ae8d17e3f334.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259545/step_08.webp"
    }
